    "quoxpert-cli": {
      "skill_md": "plugin/skills/quoxpert-cli/SKILL.md",
      "sources": [
        {
          "id": "cli-command-map",
          "repo": "quox-dashboard",
          "type": "cmd",
          "cmd": "node \"$QUOXPERT_ROOT\"/scripts/extract-cli-commands.mjs cli/lib/commands --entry=cli/bin/quox.js --format=table",
          "note": "QSDK-SKILLS audit fix 2026-07-25: this used to be a file-section pull of a \"CLI Commands (QuoxCLI)\" heading in CODEBASE_MAP.md that never existed (verified via grep), so it was silently unfetchable. Repointed at scripts/extract-cli-commands.mjs, which parses the real Commander.js `.command()`/`.description()` definitions straight out of cli/lib/commands/*.js (55 command-group files), more robust than depending on a hand-maintained doc table staying in sync, and it doesn't require running the CLI itself. fleet #432 (2026-08-21): added --entry=cli/bin/quox.js. The walk covered cli/lib/commands only, so `tui` and `completion`, registered straight off `program` in the entrypoint, had never been extractable at all. They were missing from the map because the extractor could not see them, not because it was stale.",
          "feeds": [
            "command-map"
          ],
          "stamp": {
            "sha256": "ac994be0a24ec685d1970ffe38ed5d98e2f618c7dbd89990f57d3c4fb1f74404",
            "checked_at": "2026-10-26T03:58:31.816Z",
            "repo_commit": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cli-endpoints",
          "repo": "quox-dashboard",
          "type": "file",
          "path": "cli/lib/api/endpoints.js",
          "note": "Centralized endpoint map — same anti-drift source used by cli/test/api/endpoints-lint.test.js.",
          "feeds": [
            "command-map"
          ],
          "stamp": {
            "sha256": "daf30cb110e62c709277daea0620023d7a2b0ed660adf581a9391ff3b6f88a3a",
            "checked_at": "2026-10-26T03:58:31.817Z",
            "repo_commit": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cli-flags-json",
          "repo": "quox-dashboard",
          "type": "cmd",
          "cmd": "node \"$QUOXPERT_ROOT\"/scripts/extract-cli-commands.mjs cli/lib/commands --format=json",
          "note": "QSDK-SKILLS audit fix 2026-07-25: replaces the old 'cli-help-json' source, which ran `node cli/bin/quox.js --help-json`, a flag the CLI never actually shipped (`error: unknown option '--help-json'`, live-verified). Same extractor as cli-command-map, JSON mode, for a future flag-table generator (full per-subcommand option/required-flag inventory, e.g. confirms `inbox list` only has --status/--priority/--limit, no --pending).",
          "feeds": [
            "flag-table"
          ],
          "stamp": {
            "sha256": "c8ca1859dae012f674fe1888f7856df6b93251db0d300c4aad8bccacd5891156",
            "checked_at": "2026-10-26T03:58:32.574Z",
            "repo_commit": null
